WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.125
Security Information and Event Management platforms help organizations collect, normalize, analyze, and investigate security-relevant data from across their environments.

2
00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:19.945
SIEM transforms raw logs into operational awareness by supporting searches, correlations, alerts, investigations, and reporting.

3
00:00:19.945 --> 00:00:26.989
Analysts use SIEM to understand suspicious activity, support incident response, and improve security operations.

4
00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:38.174
Although SIEM is powerful, it requires thoughtful configuration, ongoing tuning, skilled analysts, and integration with other security capabilities to deliver value.
